>Yep.  But in addition to the postings here, there is another option.
>Just forget about it.  Run around and beat the crap out of stuff, and
>don't sacrifice things.  This makes the timeout for your god to get
>over his/her angriness go faster.  Then, sacrifice away.

I don't think this is true.  I think that killing monsters only 
affects your alignment, and waiting only affects your prayer
timeout.  These are totally separate from your god's anger.

The only way to decrease your god's anger is to offer a large 
enough sacrifice.  There is no timeout for your god's anger.

